# Atlas patch to MoonshotAI/FlashKDA 1ce47ea3 (MIT), applied after flash_kda_tma_swizzle.patch:
# the recurrence in FP32, as the FP32 token recurrence computes it. The state stays in FP32 registers
# (loaded and stored as FP32), every MMA runs on split BF16 hi/lo operands with FP32 accumulation, the
# gate and beta logistic is exact, INV is an FP32 forward substitution, and v - k@S and the output sum
# are FP32. Kernel 2 owns VD value columns per CTA (half width while one wave fits) and rebuilds the
# decayed operands from q, k and g in prep warps; Kernel 1 writes only INV, Mqk and the row normalizers.
# FP32 state fragments narrowed only for the MMA operand follow vllm-project/FlashKDA#13 (MIT).

